// ---- a household's own lunch box pictures (lunch-box ADR-0015) ----
// How far a picture of a box with the family's own food has got. Only the
// `lunchPhoto` Function reads or writes it — the app is handed the Storage
// path, which `rules/storage/paths/lunch_photos.rules` guards.
match /lunchPhotos/{key} {
  allow read, write: if false;
}
